# ── Confidential: the answered Sharia review brief ────────────────────────────
# Contains scholar identity and rulings and must not live in version control.
# It WAS committed by accident (a blanket `git add -- docs` in S2) and was removed
# from this branch's history with `git filter-repo` on 2026-07-30. This exact-path
# entry stops it being re-added. Deliberately narrow: `docs/product/` legitimately
# tracks the BRD and PRD, and `docs/sharia-review-brief.md` (the UNanswered brief)
# is tracked and wanted — a broader pattern would silently hide real documentation.
# The answered brief lives outside the repo; ask the product owner for it.
docs/product/Sharia Review Brief_answered.docx

